title: "Exact directional signalling for Ising, partial-SWAP, and XY unitary families"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Exact diamond-norm evaluations and reproducible certificates for directional
  signalling in Ising, partial-SWAP, and XY/iSWAP unitary families.
